    "quote": "Suppose Assumptions~\\ref{ass:unconfound}--\\ref{ass:linear_budget} hold, and suppose the HoB oracle satisfies Abstraction~\\ref{abs:oracle_hob}. ... Run the Budget instantiation of Algorithm~\\ref{alg:dual-aware-lte} with an evenly discretized bid grid \\(\\calB\\subseteq[0,1]\\) of size \\(K\\) and learning rate \\(\\eta=\\Theta(T^{-\\frac{1}{2}})\\). Then \\Reg_T^{\\bgt}=O(d\\sqrt T\\log^2T+\\Delta_{\\hob}\\sqrt{dT}\\log T+H_\\hob+\\frac{T}{K})."
